  "intuition": "This loss encourages selecting pairs with larger cost gaps, promoting preference for higher-quality options by assigning higher scores to pairs where one option significantly outperforms the other in terms of cost difference. Using log-sigmoid applied to the scaled cost gap emphasizes the preference signal while remaining smoothly differentiable.",
